OL,3,GNEWSAWhy women have rallied behind rape
OL,4,Avictim Joanne Young
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Joanne left court after four men
OL,7,Fwere convicted of sexual offences
OL,8,Fagainst her, many were there to show
OL,9,Fshe was not facing the fight alone.
